# ruff and `npm run check:api` (a git diff on generated types) agree with CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
